   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "At 100 PB with a 0.81% annualized failure rate, drives are failing constantly. A design that treats repair as exceptional\ncannot hold eleven nines - which is why repair gets a guaranteed I/O floor that user traffic cannot preempt.",
